title: Media
new-page: true

@media
title: Media
on-arrival: kpd_media_timer = 6
view-if: kpd_media_timer <= 0 and not (labor_minister_party == "KPD" and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0)

The KPD will set the direction of their newspaper and radio

- @mobilize
- @campaign
- @ideological
- @radio
- @radio_2
- @radio_3
- @radio_4

@mobilize
title: Die Rote Fahne will mobilize the public against fascism, capitalism, and monarchism
on-arrival: {!
    rfb_strength += 50;
    rfb_militancy += 0.02;
    
    if (kpd_wholesome) {
        workers_nsdap -= 1*(1 - dissent);
        unemployed_nsdap -= 2*(1 - dissent);
    } else {
        workers_spd -= 1*(1 - dissent);
        unemployed_spd -= 2*(1 - dissent);
    }

    if (dnf_formed) {
        workers_dnf -= 1*(1 - dissent);
        unemployed_dnf -= 2*(1 - dissent);
    } else {
        workers_dnvp -= 1*(1 - dissent);
        unemployed_dnvp -= 2*(1 - dissent);
    }

    workers_kpd += 1*(1 - dissent);
    unemployed_kpd += 2*(1-dissent);
!}

Die Rote Fahne coordinates with the KPD and RFB to organize protests, rallies, and strikes

@campaign
title: Die Rote Fahne will highlight the failues of the SPD and the Weimar Republic
on-arrival: kpd_campaign_media += 1; workers_kpd += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_kpd += 4*(1-dissent);

Die Rote Fahne rails against the SPD's support of class collaboration and capitalism

@ideological
title: Die Rote Fahne will tow the party line
on-arrival: {!
    if (kpd_leader == "Thälmann") {
        kpd_stalinist_strength += 3;
        kpd_weddinger_strength -= 3;
        kpd_conciliator_strength -= 3;
        kpd_brandlerite_strength -= 3;

        kpd_stalinist_dissent -= 10;
    } else if (kpd_leader == "Conciliators") {
        kpd_conciliator_strength += 3;
        kpd_weddinger_strength -= 3;
        kpd_stalinist_strength -= 3;
        kpd_brandlerite_strength -= 3;

        kpd_conciliator_dissent -= 10;
    } else if (kpd_leader == "Brandlerites") {
        kpd_brandlerite_strength += 3;
        kpd_conciliator_strength -= 3;
        kpd_weddinger_strength -= 3;
        kpd_stalinist_strength -= 3;

        kpd_brandlerite_dissent -= 10;
    } else if (kpd_leader == "Weddingers") {
        kpd_weddinger_strength += 3;
        kpd_conciliator_strength -= 3;
        kpd_stalinist_strength += 3;
        kpd_brandlerite_strength -= 3;

        kpd_weddinger_dissent -= 10;
    }
!}

